4 U3 pin 3 (SCL)\"}, {\"source\": \"schematic\", \"quote\": \"PCB.kicad_sch sheet 1/3: NFC_IC sheet pins NET0012 (routed to PB8, pin 61) and NET0008 (routed to PB9, pin 62); nfc_ic.kicad_sch sheet 2/3: NET0012 on SDA pin 5, NET0008 on SCL pin 3\"}], \"impact\": \"SDA and SCL are swapped at the MCU. Unless the firmware is configured for this swap, I2C communication with the NT3H2111 fails.\", \"confidence\": 0.4}]}",
